==Battleground==
*The enemy base here is a [[Clown Base (Enemy Base)|Clown Base]].
*5 [[Doge Dark]]s spawn after 10 seconds<sup>300f</sup>, delay 20~26.67 seconds<sup>600f~800f</sup>.
*When the base reaches 99% HP:
**1 [[The Face]] spawns as the boss.
**10 [[Doge Dark]]s spawn after 3.33 seconds<sup>100f</sup>, delay 4~6 seconds<sup>120f~180f</sup>.
**10 [[Doge Dark]]s spawn after 16.67 seconds<sup>500f</sup>, delay 3~5 seconds<sup>90f~150f</sup>.
**10 [[Doge Dark]]s spawn after 33.33 seconds<sup>1,000f</sup>, delay 2~4 seconds<sup>60f~120f</sup>.

==Strategy==
[[Swimmer Cat (Super Rare Cat)|Swimmer Cat]] and a [[:Category:Waver-class Cats|Waver]] like [[Crazed Gross Cat (Super Rare Cat)|Crazed Gross]], along with some fast [[:Category:Meatshield-class Cats|meatshields]] like [[Cow Cat (Normal Cat)|Lion Cat]] and [[Crazed Cat (Super Rare Cat)|Crazed Cat]] are all you need to beat this stage quickly. [[Bahamut Cat (Special Cat)|Awakened Bahamut]] is also a good choice for rushing.

